#: scenario:scenario_483E424D_25A2_4B03_8534_36B2371F1FA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7365cbb390d6ab5ce4979b212c7bad7626d4533d95a2a73f37bbfcf6a057bff
