#: scenario:scenario_40443B05_EDC4_475C_BED6_60B08F7565D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2424b08545e4ee159e4256ac1dc1799df29d088a8b10bac20966ae06ab44a239
